# Ley Orgánica 3/2018, de protección de datos personales y garantía de los
# derechos digitales, as the Boletín Oficial del Estado serves it.
#
# The BOE is Spain's official gazette. Its text is set by the state printer to
# a published house standard, which is the only property this gate cares about:
# a finding here is a suspected false positive rather than a hit.
#
# The XML endpoint rather than the web page, because the page wraps the law in
# navigation and the XML does not. `fecha_actualizacion` in the document means
# this is the consolidated text, so it moves when the law is amended; the gate
# fingerprint is what notices.
#
# format: xml   region: <texto>
#
# A second column is an Internet Archive capture: fixed bytes, so a rebuild
# reproduces instead of resampling. A URL without one is fetched live, and
# `--live` ignores the column entirely. gates/README.md has the coverage.
https://www.boe.es/diario_boe/xml.php?id=BOE-A-2018-16673 20260112084931
